Typography: Inter 600 display + Inter 400 body. 16px base, 1.25 type ratio (16 / 20 / 25 / 31 / 39). Humanist, quiet, precise.
Radius: 4px controls, 6px cards, 999px pills.
Spacing: 8 / 16 / 24 / 40 / 64. Section padding 64px desktop, 32px at 375px. Lots of air.
Shadow/depth: None. 1px borders only (border-gray-200). Depth via spacing, not shadows.
Color: Off-white #FAFAF9 background, ink #111111 text, one accent #2563EB. No gradients. Body contrast >= 4.5:1.
